, x) float32 35MB dask.array<chunksize=(35, 499, 499), meta=np.ndarray>\n│           VRADH                (vcp_time, y, x) float32 35MB dask.array<chunksize=(35, 499, 499), meta=np.ndarray>\n│           DBZH                 (vcp_time, y, x) float32 35MB dask.array<chunksize=(35, 499, 499), meta=np.ndarray>\n│           PHIDP                (vcp_time, y, x) float32 35MB dask.array<chunksize=(35, 499, 499), meta=np.ndarray>\n│           ZDR                  (vcp_time, y, x) float32 35MB dask.array<chunksize=(35, 499, 499), meta=np.ndarray>\n│           WRADH                (vcp_time, y, x) float32 35MB dask.array<chunksize=(35, 499, 499), meta=np.ndarray>\n│           uPhiDP               (vcp_time, y, x) float32 35MB dask.array<chunksize=(35, 499, 499), meta=np.ndarray>\n│           ray_elevation_angle  (vcp_time, azimuth) float64 101kB dask.array<chunksize=(35, 360), meta=np.ndarray>\n│           sweep_number         (vcp_time) float32 140B dask.array<chunksize=(35,), meta=np.ndarray>\n│           sweep_fixed_angle    (vcp_time) float32 140B dask.array<chunksize=(35,), meta=np.ndarray>\n└── Group: /fgora\n        Dimensions:              (vcp_time: 38, y: 499, x: 499, azimuth: 360)\n        Coordinates: (12/13)\n          * vcp_time             (vcp_time) datetime64[ns] 304B 2017-08-12T15:00:00 ....\n          * y                    (y) float64 4kB -3.117e+06 -3.118e+06 ... -3.615e+06\n          * x                    (x) float64 4kB 4.282e+06 4.283e+06 ... 4.78e+06\n          * azimuth              (azimuth) float64 3kB 0.5 1.5 2.5 ... 357.5 358.5 359.5\n            elevation            (azimuth) float64 3kB dask.array<chunksize=(360,), meta=np.ndarray>\n            time                 (vcp_time, azimuth) datetime64[ns] 109kB dask.array<chunksize=(38, 360), meta=np.ndarray>\n            ...                   ...\n            follow_mode          <U7 28B ...\n            longitude            float64 8B ...\n            altitude             float64 8B ...\n         